  "prompt": "Which 3 campaigns of each channel got the most clicks in 2025? Use the ad_spend_daily rows whose spend_date, a UTC day, falls in 2025. Keep exactly 3 campaigns per channel, or every campaign when a channel has fewer than 3 with spend. When campaigns of a channel tie on clicks, the lower campaign_id comes first. Return three columns, in this order: channel_name, campaign_id and clicks, the campaign's 2025 clicks. Return one row for each campaign kept. Any row order is fine.",
